{
 "tensatory": "0.1",
 "name": "symbolic N-D",
 "summary": "Symbolic fields on 4D and 5D spaces — Gaussians, quadratic forms, Rosenbrock, waves — viewed through 2D / 3D slices (the slice row of the bundle panel).",
 "details": "Fields defined by expressions on 4- and 5-dimensional manifolds. The viewer cannot draw four dimensions, so each space is shown as an axis-aligned 2D or 3D SLICE through the manifold's `origin`: pick the axes in the bundle panel's slice row (2 or 3 of them) and commit with the tick. Everything downstream — colour, isolines / isosurfaces, streamlines, glyphs, exact gradients, |∇| — is computed for the N-D field restricted to that slice (|∇f| keeps all N components; a vector field shows its components along the slice). Generated by tools/symbolic-nd/build.mjs.",
